OL,3,GNEWSA'Clarity needed' over harmed
OL,4,Acancer patient support
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust which harmed breast cancer
OL,7,Fpatients is failing to offer a
OL,8,F"consistent approach" to the
OL,9,Fpsychological support provided to them,
OL,10,Faccording to lawyers.
OL,12,FHundreds experienced harm under County
OL,13,FDurham and Darlington NHS Foundation
OL,14,FTrust, according to a review of cases
OL,15,Fdating back to 2023.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
