OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Clarity needed' over harmed
OL,4,Acancer patient support
OL,5,
OL,6,FMental health support is being offered
OL,7,Fby the trust to all those who
OL,8,Fexperienced psychological harm due to
OL,9,Fits substandard breast cancer care, but
OL,10,Flawyer Kudzai Matsika, who is working
OL,11,Ffor former patients, said there was a
OL,12,Flack of information about how much
OL,13,Fsupport was actually available.
OL,15,FThe trust said psychological treatment
OL,16,Fwas by its nature "highly individual
OL,17,Fand personalised".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
